  "decision_conditions": [
    "1. SCC needs to follow the Richmond template version\r\n2. The existing floor plans indicate the building is split into 3 flats and office space, which is consistent with planning history for the site. In addition, the supporting statement notes the proposal is for 'Conversion of the mixed use property (3 self-contained flats plus offices (ancillary to school)) into four self-contained 1-bedroom flats.' This appears to be correct, but the application is inconsistent with this as it refers to the change of use of a single dwellinghouse. We recommend you update the application form and we will then apply this to a revised description of development..\r\nhttps://www.richmond.gov.uk/services/planning/make_a_planning_application/planning_application_forms"
  ],
